  "content": "<p>对于1.18.2及更早版本，请参考<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/create-copper-zinc-automation\" rel=\"nofollow\">数据包版本</a></p><p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/X7ykZhG/banner.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"422\"></p><h2>关于</h2><p>Create: Copper &amp; Zinc 是一个简单模组，为 Create 添加了两种新配方：蓝矾岩和绿矾岩。这些方块经过处理后可为玩家提供可再生的铜和锌来源。</p><h2>预览 (1.6.0+)</h2><p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/sWJZh8F/2s.png\" width=\"1060\" height=\"400\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/cYf81Qh/1s.png\" width=\"1060\" height=\"400\"></p><h2>预览 (1.5.0)</h2><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/ctyMmvN/gallery-2.png\" width=\"1060\" height=\"400\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/t3H7NCd/gallery-1.png\" width=\"1060\" height=\"400\"></p>\n</div><h2>依赖项</h2><p>仅需基础<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create</a>模组即可使上述配方生效。</p><p>推荐但不强制要求安装<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jei\" rel=\"nofollow\">JEI</a>。</p><h2>安装</h2><p>将.jar模组文件放入您的mods文件夹。</p><p>您也可以在CurseForge启动器中搜索此模组（若未显示，可尝试输入作者名称）。找到后点击\"安装\"即可将其添加至您的整合包。</p><h2>权限说明</h2><p>您可自由地将本模组加入任何公开或私人的整合包。</p><h2>支持我的作品</h2><p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/vL9gzRz/image.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"20\"> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/robinfrt/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>在CurseForge下载我的项目</strong></a><br> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/FY9Qzzy/favicon-V2.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252frobinfrt\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>在Modrinth下载我的项目</strong></a><br> <img src=\"https://tinyurl.com/ffeam6b7\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fdonate%252f%253fhosted_button_id%253dXZ22AETPTQBD4\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>通过Paypal赞助</strong></a></p>",
